// Snowy conifer stand. Opaque terrain tile - no outline (it butts against
// neighbouring tiles) and deliberately asymmetric, so no MIRRORX here.
// Two snow-capped pines with layered branch tiers, lit from the left,
// over a snow ground plane that darkens toward the foreground.
